## Problem

# Current delegation syntax is verbose (~15 tokens of structure per call):
# ```bash
# b00t agent delegate sm0l 'cargo test -p b00t-cli' --output-contract='PASS|FAIL:<5lines>'
# ```

# Agents writing swarm prompts repeat this structure for every sub-task.
# Output contracts are not linked to `model-routing.tomllm` — they're hardcoded strings.

## Finished State

# Agent prompts use `@tier:` prefix syntax:
# ```
# @sm0l: cargo test -p b00t-cli
# @ch0nky: implement OKR datum schema from PRD-ARCH-001
# @frontier: evaluate security model for delta patch signing
# ```

# `b00t hive run` parses `@tier:` prefixes, looks up output contract from
# `model-routing.tomllm`, expands to full `b00t agent delegate` call.

# Output contracts are canonical — defined once in `model-routing.tomllm`, not per-call.

## Macro Expansion Rules

# | Input | Expands to |
# |-------|-----------|
# | `@sm0l: <cmd>` | `b00t agent delegate sm0l '<cmd>' --output-contract='PASS\|FAIL:<5lines>'` |
# | `@ch0nky: <desc>` | `b00t agent delegate ch0nky '<desc>' --output-contract='diff+test'` |
# | `@frontier: <q>` | `b00t agent delegate frontier '<q>' --output-contract='decision+rationale'` |
# | `@sm0l[task-id]: <cmd>` | same + `--task=<task-id>` to update task status on completion |

## Rhai Integration

# Macros defined as Rhai functions in `_b00t_/delegation-macros.rhai` (embedded in hive profile):
# ```rhai
# fn sm0l(cmd) { delegate("sm0l", cmd, model_routing::output_contract("sm0l")) }
# fn ch0nky(desc) { delegate("ch0nky", desc, model_routing::output_contract("ch0nky")) }
# fn frontier(q) { delegate("frontier", q, model_routing::output_contract("frontier")) }
# ```

# `b00t hive run` pre-processes stdin for `@tier:` patterns before exec.

## Acceptance Criteria

# - [ ] `@sm0l: <cmd>` in `b00t hive run` stdin expands correctly (verified by dry-run output)
# - [ ] Output contracts loaded from `model-routing.tomllm`, not hardcoded
# - [ ] `@sm0l[task-id]:` syntax updates b00t task status after delegate returns
# - [ ] Unrecognized `@foo:` prefix → warning, not silent drop
# - [ ] `b00t hive run --dry-run` shows expansion without executing

## Sub-tasks

# | # | title | tier | file |
# |---|-------|------|------|
# | 1 | Parser: detect `@tier[opt]:` prefix in hive run stdin | sm0l | `b00t-cli/src/commands/hive.rs` |
# | 2 | Load output contracts from model-routing.tomllm at expand time | sm0l | `b00t-cli/src/hive.rs` |
# | 3 | Rhai macro registration for sm0l/ch0nky/frontier | sm0l | `_b00t_/delegation-macros.rhai` |
# | 4 | `--task=<id>` flag on delegate: update task status on return | ch0nky | `b00t-cli/src/k0mmand3r/mod.rs` |
# | 5 | Integration test: `echo '@sm0l: echo hi' \| b00t hive run --dry-run` | sm0l | `tests/delegation_macros.rs` |

## Dependencies

# - PRD-ARCH-001 (OKR) — optional but `@sm0l[task-id]:` needs task status update
# - model-routing.tomllm must have `output_contract` field per tier (add if missing)

